; ===== FloppyMFM_ComputeChecksum =====
; prototype: unsigned int __usercall FloppyMFM_ComputeChecksum@<d0>(const void *p@<a0>, unsigned int bytes@<d1>)
FloppyMFM_ComputeChecksum:
                move.l  d2,-(sp)
