; ===== FloppyMFM_DecodeInterleavedTrack =====
; prototype: void __usercall FloppyMFM_DecodeInterleavedTrack(const void *src@<a0>, void *dst@<a1>)
FloppyMFM_DecodeInterleavedTrack:
