; ===== FloppyMFM_EncodeBuffer =====
; prototype: void __usercall FloppyMFM_EncodeBuffer(const void *src@<a0>, void *dst@<a1>, unsigned int sizeBytes@<d0>)
FloppyMFM_EncodeBuffer:
